 "not_scheduled": [
  "Bicheon Castle Siege: every 4 weeks (dated cards above).",
  "Sabuk Clash: every 8 weeks on the Domination server, 3 Sundays 22:00-23:00 after a Castle Siege week (F1239). Which siege starts the next cycle is not announced, so no timer.",
  "Clan Match: every 8 weeks (F1757); next date not announced.",
  "Drakazan (Domination world boss): dormant Monday 02:00, wakes on a random weekday, appears 21:10 on its day (F703). Random, so no timer.",
  "Valley of Life and Death: biweekly seasons; current season dates not published."
 ],
 "dst_note": "Server clocks are fixed offsets and do not use daylight saving: a Feb 2026 notice still lists NA as UTC-4 (F2377). Pacific time leaves daylight saving on Sun Nov 1, 2026 (UTC-7 to UTC-8), so from Nov 1 every server-time event shows 1 hour EARLIER in PT (e.g. NA 22:00 = 7:00 pm PT now, 6:00 pm PT after Nov 1). The countdowns handle this automatically."
}